{
  "lecture_id": "lecture-08",
  "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "小卷积核只连接局部邻域；浅层示例中相距很远的输入节点无法共同影响一个节点。attention 用跨 token 混合来处理此类关系。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 4
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "token 是封装信息的向量。图像可切成 patches，每个 patch 经线性投影成为 d 维 token，N 个 tokens 作为矩阵 T 的行。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 14
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 14
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "标量权重作用于整条 token 向量；左乘 W 对 token 行作线性组合。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 17
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "同一 F_θ 独立作用于各 token；通常 F_θ 是 MLP，此步本身不跨 token 汇聚。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 18
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "普通线性层直接学习 W；attention 则由输入构造 A，使混合权重随当前 tokens 改变。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 20
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 34
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "同一输入集产生 Q、K、V；QK^T 给出所有 query-key 匹配，经缩放和 softmax 得 A，随后 AV 汇聚 values。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 34
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 30
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 34
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "k 个 heads 分别计算 attention，按 token 行拼接为 N×kv，再用 W_MSA 投影回 d 维。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 37
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "课件展示的块依次使用 token norm、MSA、残差，再使用 token norm、逐 token MLP、残差，并重复 L 次。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 39
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 39
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "输入 token 行被置换时，输出行作相同置换；这不是逐项输出不变。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 41
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "把 x、y 坐标在多尺度正弦上的值组织成位置向量并附加到 token 表示，使空间位置可区分。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 43
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 43
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "causal mask 阻止当前位置依赖未来 tokens；一次前向仍能并行监督多个 next-token 位置，多层连接保持因果。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 51
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 51
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "图像到文本架构用 image self-attention 编码视觉 tokens；文本侧用 causal self-attention，并让文本 queries 对图像 keys/values 做 cross-attention。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 54
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
